SUMMARY:HALLOWEEN LUNCH ~ West First Wood-fired Pizza/Treat Street Carniva
 l 👻🤩🧛‍♀️🎃
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**For Halloween let’s have delicio
 us pizza at West First Wood-fired Pizza in downtown Hendersonville! 🍕
 👻 I’m only allowed 12 people so sign up quickly if you want to attend
 ! * See note below about now having an additional six.**\n**Sorry ~ no gue
 sts allowed since I’m limited in how many attendees I can have at the re
 staurant.**\n\n*********** **I called the restaurant ~ they are allowing m
 e six additional seats! Yay! But they will be at a separate table upstairs
  whereas 12 will be downstairs.******\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE:** **www.westfirst
 woodfired.com**\n**They have gluten-free\, vegetarian and vegan options. T
 hey also offer a full-service bar. 🍕🍷 🍺**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️**
  **Come a little early to find a parking place. It can be challenging. 
 🚗 🚙**\n\n**PETS: 🐶** **Sorry\, no pets are allowed. 😞**\n\n**T
 ABLE RESERVATIONS:** **🍽️** **We have table reservations for a party 
 of 12 downstairs on Halloween/Saturday - October 31 at 12:30 PM.**\n**Tabl
 e reservations for an additional party of 6 at 12:30 PM upstairs.**\n\n**H
 ALLOWEEN COSTUMES: It’s Halloween so dress up if you like. Not mandatory
 \, but it would be fun! 🤩 🧛👻 I am!**\n\n**NOTE: There will be a T
 reat Street Carnival on Main Street from 2PM - 5PM if you would like to se
 e the cute kids in Halloween costumes! At 3:00PM there will be a costume c
 ontest in front of the historic courthouse which is only 48 feet (literall
 y!) ~ a 1-minute walk ~ from the restaurant where we will be having lunch.
  So check it out! 🧛👻🤩🥸 For more info: https://www.hendersoncou
 ntync.gov/recreation/page/treat-street-2026.**\n\n**HAPPY HALLOWEEN!!🎃 
 👻🧛‍♀️**\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\n**Shae Kemerer ~ Organizer**\n**(82
 8)699-8180 (I prefer text for I work and I can’t always answer my phone)
 **\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**
