SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Day Dinner ~ The Veranda Rest./The 1927 Lake Lure Inn
  & Spa 🍁🎃🦃
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Come join me for a delicious Thank
 sgiving buffet in the Veranda Room Restaurant inside the beautiful 1927 La
 ke Lure Inn & Spa in Lake Lure\, N.C! It’s all you can eat so come hungr
 y! 😋**\n**Besides the buffet they also have a full bar if you wish to h
 ave a cocktail or wine with your meal. 🍹 🍷**\n\n**COST:** **$64.95 p
 er adult (does not include tax & gratuity)**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE:** **If you
  have difficulty finding the menu just** **google** **Lake Lure Inn & Spa 
 Thanksgiving menu. It will show last year’s menu\, but the manager said 
 it would be the same this year.**\n**www.Lakelurenc.com**\n\n**TRAVELING: 
 All routes to Lake Lure are now open. 🚗**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️** **Ple
 nty of** **parking** **available.**\n\n**RESERVATIONS:** **We have table r
 eservations at 12:30 PM in the Veranda Room Restaurant**\n**inside the Lak
 e Lure Inn & Spa.**\n\n**NOTE:** **After you eat you might want to go down
  to Morse Park and walk the paved & gravel trails and see the Lake Lure Ga
 zebo. The Lake Lure Marina is also open now and nice to walk around. It’
 s all only 0.5 miles (a 3-minute drive) from the restaurant. You can also 
 drive down to Chimney Rock which is only 1.3 miles away. A 5-minute drive.
  I plan on taking a little after-dinner walk at Morse Park & the Lake Lure
  Marina so come join me! 🚶‍♀️🚶**\n\n**HAPPY THANKSGIVING!! 
 🦃🍁 🍂**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae (828)699-8180 (call or 
 text)**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**
