SUMMARY:Christmas Show 🎄🎅 ~ Celebrating 10 Years!! Flat Rock Playhou
 se 🎭 
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**‘Tis the season so let’s get i
 n the holiday season spirit by enjoying the Christmas Show/Celebrating 10 
 years at the Flat Rock Playhouse! 🎭 🎄🤶**\n\n**TICKETS: (non-refun
 dable) If you are unable to attend your ticket can be used for another per
 formance. Please call box office for more details.**\n**Tickets ~ $60/$70/
 $80**\n**Please go to the website to view the seating chart.Flatrockplayho
 use.org**\n\n**NOTE: Remember that we are going on Thursday\, December 3 a
 t the 2:00 PM performance when you purchase your tickets.**\n\n**WEBSITE &
  PHONE #:**\n**Flatrockplayhouse.org.**\n**(828)693-0731**\n**You might wa
 nt to call to get more information about seating. That’s what I did\, an
 d the lady was very helpful.**\n\n**LENGTH OF PLAY: 2 hours with a 15 minu
 te intermission.**\n\n**PARKING: Plenty of parking available.**\n\n**WHERE
  TO MEET:**\n**Since we all may be sitting on different levels we will mee
 t in front of the playhouse prior to the performance. I’ll be there arou
 nd 1:30 at the benches.**\n\n**A BITE TO EAT AFTER THE PLAY:**\n**We will 
 have reservations (limited) at Campfire Grill just down the road. Please R
 SVP to each meetup separately.**\n\n**IMPORTANT: If you want to get a good
  seat I suggest you get your tickets now. Even though the performance isn
 ’t until December the seats are already filling up fast!**\n\n**I hope y
 ou will come and spend a fun afternoon with me! 🎭 Merry Christmas! 🎄
 🎁**\n\n**Questions?**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (call 
 or text. I prefer text for I work\, but I will return your call).**
