SUMMARY:Passerelle Bistro/Liberty Pedestrian Bridge at Falls Park/Christma
 s Market 🎄🎅
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Let’s go to Greenville\, South C
 arolina on a little day trip. Everything should be really festive for the 
 holidays! I’ve made us table reservations at Passerelle (translated mean
 s “Foot Bridge”) Bistro located on the banks of the Reedy River in Fal
 ls Park. The Passerelle Bistro** **serves** **French cuisine. It is known 
 for its classic bistro fare and comfort food.**\n\n**MENU:🍷** **To see 
 their menu please go to: www.passerelleinthepark.com**\n\n**THE LIBERTY BR
 IDGE:** **The bridge is a suspension foot bridge at Falls Park on the Reed
 y River. It goes directly over the Reedy River Falls. By the way\, we are 
 literally a one minute walk from the bistro to the pedestrian bridge! It w
 ill be nice to eat then take a nice stroll over the bridge.**\n\n**In Fall
 s Park there are trails\, gardens\, shops\, craft beer pubs\, and restaura
 nts. The park & bridge are free and open to the public.**\n\n**To really g
 et a jest of the Falls Park\, the Reedy River\, the Liberty Bridge over th
 e falls\, please go to: www.greenvillesc.gov. There are photos & videos\, 
 and tons of information. You also might want to google Liberty Bridge at F
 alls Park. So much information!**\n\n**CHRISTMAS MARKET:🎄The Christmas 
 market is just a hop & skip from the bistro! Just walk across the Liberty 
 Pedestrian Bridge (right outside the bistro) over to the Grand Bohemian Lo
 dge. There will be over 50 local businesses and artisans\, holiday food & 
 beverages\, live music\, a live Christmas tree and Santa!**\n**🎄🎅 ww
 w.greenvillechristmasmarket.com.**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️** **The manager o
 f the bistro informed me that we should be able to find a parking place ne
 ar the bistro. If not\, there are several parking garages nearby and they 
 offer the first hour of parking free.**\n\n**CARPOOLING: 🚗 If you are w
 illing to carpool please leave a comment in the comment section.**\n\n**TA
 BLE RESERVATIONS:🍴We have table reservations at 12:30 PM. on Saturday\,
  December 5. Please allow yourself enough time to travel if you’re comin
 g from outside South Carolina like I am.**\n\n**Hope you will join me for 
 this little day trip to**\n**Greenville! Let’s enjoy the holiday season!
 🎄**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS?**\n**Shae (828)699-8180) Text or call**\n*
 *Shae.Kemerer@aol.com**
