SUMMARY:IHOP ~ Breakfast & Brunch Restaurant (* Meetup to carpool to Grove
  Park Inn)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**IHOP Restaurant is where those who
  are carpooling with Dawn will meet up to go to The Gingerbread House Comp
 etition at Grove Park Inn & Spa. If you wish to eat please be there at 9:0
 0 AM. If you wish not to eat please be there no later than 10:15 AM. We wi
 ll wait for 15 minutes and then depart exactly at 10:30 AM so as to be on 
 time to meet the others at Grove Park Inn who will not be going to IHOP fi
 rst.**\n\n**MENU:** **For those eating check out the menu at: www.restaura
 nts.ihop.com.**\n\n**PARKING:🅿️ Plenty of parking.**\n\n**By the way\
 , any members who wish to just join us at IHOP to eat and not go to Grove 
 Park Inn are welcome to do so! See you there! ☕️ 🍳 🥓**\n\n**QUES
 TIONS?**\n**Shae ~ (828)699-8180**\n**Shae.Kemerer@aol.com**
