SUMMARY:Omni Grove Park Inn & Spa /Annual National Gingerbread House Compe
 tition ~ FREE!
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The National Gingerbread House Com
 petition is a nationally recognized competition and display at the Omni Gr
 ove Park Inn & Spa. Admission is FREE. The display of gingerbread houses f
 eatures whimsical and elaborate handmade gingerbread houses of every size\
 , shape\, complexity\, and theme. A must-see! You will see everything from
  rustic cabins to elaborate castles — all built from edible materials an
 d made of at least 75% gingerbread. Contestants from all over the country 
 submit their creations from across four age categories ~ adult\, teen\, yo
 uth\, and child.**\n\n**Besides seeing the gingerbread houses enjoy the en
 ormous fireplaces\, dozens of decorated Christmas trees with different the
 mes\, and the historic beauty of the Grove Park Inn. Also\, treat yourself
  to their homemade hot chocolate or a hot toddy from the bar. That’s wha
 t I plan on doing! I want a hot-buttered rum and to sit in one of the rock
 ing chairs in front of one of those huge fireplaces! Ahhhh! 🔥 🍹Come 
 join me!**\n\n**To read more about all that is offered at the Inn google T
 he National Gingerbread House Competition for there are many articles and 
 beautiful photos of gingerbread houses. You can also go to: www.omnihotels
 .com.**\n\n**PUBLIC VIEWING:** **👀** **Unless you’re a registered gue
 st of the hotel the gingerbread houses can only be viewed Monday-Thursday.
  That’s why our meetup is not scheduled for the weekend.**\n\n**PETS: 
 🐶** **Only pets of registered guests are allowed.**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿
 ️** **Admission is free\, but parking certainly isn’t!**\n**Valet: $40
  for day parking.**\n**Self-parking: $30 for day parking.**\n**The proceed
 s from parking benefits local non-profits.**\n\n**CARPOOLING: 🚗** **I e
 ncourage carpooling due to the price of parking. If you’re willing to do
  so please comment in the comment section for this meetup event. Please le
 ave contact info.**\n\n**DAWN/CARPOOLING: 🚙** **Dawn has a nice-size Fl
 ex Ford and can accept five passengers. The first five to respond get the 
 seats! We will be doing the valet parking for $40 plus tip. Split seven wa
 ys (that includes Dawn & me) it will be about $7-$8 per person. Beats payi
 ng the whole $40!**\n**If you wish to carpool with Dawn please text me (pl
 ease no phone calls for I work and my phone will be off) or email me. All 
 others who wish to let others ride with them please make a comment in the 
 comment section. My contact information is at bottom.**\n**For those ridin
 g with Dawn we will be meeting up at IHOP Restaurant on Airport Rd. Please
  read the separate meetup event for IHOP. Dawn & I will be having breakfas
 t there prior to leaving for the Grove Park Inn. Come join us or just come
  before we depart (Again\, for details please look at the separate meetup 
 event for IHOP). I know this is a lot of information so please text or ema
 il me with any questions.**\n\n**DINING:🍴I tried to get dining at the I
 nn\, but for a large group they now require you to pay in advance for ever
 yone with only one credit card. No can do. I also wanted the Sunset Terrac
 e\, but they close in early November. Several of the restaurants are seaso
 nal. But if you want something to eat while there they do serve food at th
 eir many on-site bars & restaurants (that are not seasonal).**\n\n**Again\
 , please text or email me (info. below) if you wish to carpool (first come
 \, first serve) with Dawn or if you simply have some questions.**\n\n**WHE
 RE TO MEET ME:** **For those NOT carpooling with Dawn I will meet you insi
 de the main entrance/lobby of the Inn at 11:30 AM. I’ll be in the area o
 f one of the two huge fireplaces ~ preferably the one where I can get a ro
 cker in front of the fireplace. 🔥 Text or call me if you can’t find m
 e. (828)699-8180. Hope to see you there! Tis the season! 🎄 🎄🎄**\n
 \n**QUESTIONS?**\n**Shae ~ (828)699-8180**\n**Shae.Kemerer@aol.com**
