SUMMARY:Christmas Day Dinner ~ German Style! 🎄 🍷 🎅 🇩🇪 
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**It was quite a challenge to find a
  restaurant that would take a group larger than six people on Christmas Da
 y! So we are having a non-traditional Christmas Day dinner at Haus Heidelb
 erg German Restaurant in Hendersonville. We may not have turkey or ham\, b
 ut there will be other delicious dishes to choose from so please come join
  me!**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE:** **They will have their regular full German men
 u alongside a special holiday multi-course menu\, plus some seasonal dishe
 s like Sahne Schnitzel and Debreziner. And\, of course\, their imported be
 ers & wines will be offered. 🍺 🍷 www.hausheidelberg.com**\n\n**TABLE
  RESERVATIONS:** **Our table reservations will be at 5:00 PM. That’s the
  only time slot they had available for a large group.**\n\n**PARKING:** **
 🅿️ You may park around the side of the restaurant and in the rear if 
 you can’t find available parking out front.**\n\n**Please come join me f
 or a German-style Christmas dinner! 🥘 🍷 🍺 Merry Christmas! 🎄 
 🎅**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)828-69
 9-8180 (Text or call)**
